---
import ServiceLayout from '../../layouts/ServiceLayout.astro';
import FAQSchema from '../../components/FAQSchema.astro';
import { serviceFAQs } from '../../data/serviceFAQs';
import { getService } from '../../data/services';

const service = getService('permanent-tint-all-over');

const pageTitle = "All Over Hair Colour, $140, North Auckland";
const pageDescription = "Permanent tint, all-over colour in Kaukapakapa, North Auckland. $140, about 1.5-2 hours with Melissa. Full grey coverage, free parking, book online.";

const faqs = serviceFAQs['permanent-tint-all-over'];
---

<ServiceLayout
  title={pageTitle}
  description={pageDescription}
  price={service.price}
  duration={service.duration}
  h1={service.h1}
  serviceName={service.name}
  image="/images/optimized/updo-styling_800.webp"
>
  <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Complete Colour Transformation from Roots to Ends</h2>
  
  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
    Transform your entire look with our all-over colour service, delivering rich, vibrant, and uniform colour from roots to ends. Whether you're covering grey, changing your shade completely, or enhancing your natural colour, this comprehensive service ensures beautiful, long-lasting results that make a statement.
  </p>

  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
    Covering grey? Melissa also does grey blending, which keeps regrowth softer. Read <a href="/blog/grey-blending-vs-grey-coverage/" class="text-salon-darkblue underline hover:text-[#0F7A9C]">grey blending vs grey coverage</a>.
  </p>

  <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">The Power of All-Over Colour</h3>
  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
    All-over colour is the ultimate solution for complete hair transformation. Unlike touch-ups that focus on roots, this service applies fresh colour to your entire head, ensuring even coverage and vibrant results. It's perfect for dramatic colour changes, correcting uneven tones, or refreshing faded colour throughout your hair.
  </p>

  <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Benefits of Full Colour Application</h3>
  <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 mb-6 space-y-2">
    <li>Complete, even colour from root to tip</li>
    <li>100% grey coverage throughout</li>
    <li>Ability to dramatically change your shade</li>
    <li>Corrects uneven or patchy colour</li>
    <li>Refreshes dull, faded ends</li>
    <li>Creates rich, multi-dimensional results</li>
    <li>Long-lasting colour that maintains vibrancy</li>
    <li>Healthier appearance with conditioning benefits</li>
  </ul>

  <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Ideal Candidates</h3>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6">
    <div class="bg-[#F8F9FA] rounded-lg p-4">
      <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2">First-Time Colour</h4>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">Virgin hair ready for transformation</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-[#F8F9FA] rounded-lg p-4">
      <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2">Colour Correction</h4>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">Fixing uneven or undesired colour</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-[#F8F9FA] rounded-lg p-4">
      <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2">Major Changes</h4>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">Going lighter or darker by multiple levels</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-[#F8F9FA] rounded-lg p-4">
      <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2">Grey Coverage</h4>
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">Complete coverage for high grey percentage</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Colour Selection Process</h3>
  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
    Choosing the perfect shade is crucial for achieving your desired look. Melissa considers:
  </p>
  <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 mb-6 space-y-2">
    <li><strong>Skin tone:</strong> Warm, cool, or neutral undertones guide colour selection</li>
    <li><strong>Eye color:</strong> Complementary shades that make your eyes pop</li>
    <li><strong>Lifestyle:</strong> Maintenance requirements and professional considerations</li>
    <li><strong>Personal style:</strong> Classic, trendy, or bold colour choices</li>
    <li><strong>Hair condition:</strong> Current health affects colour processing</li>
  </ul>

  <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">The Application Process</h3>
  <ol class="list-decimal list-inside text-gray-700 mb-6 space-y-2">
    <li>Thorough consultation and colour matching</li>
    <li>Strand test if needed for dramatic changes</li>
    <li>Pre-treatment to equalise porosity</li>
    <li>Systematic application starting at roots</li>
    <li>Working through mid-lengths to ends</li>
    <li>Processing time customised to your hair</li>
    <li>Gentle emulsification for even distribution</li>
    <li>Colour-locking treatment and conditioning</li>
    <li>Professional finish to showcase new colour</li>
  </ol>

  <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Popular Colour Transformations</h3>
  <div class="bg-[#F8F9FA] rounded-lg p-6 mb-6">
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2">
      <li><strong>Rich Brunettes:</strong> Chocolate, espresso, chestnut</li>
      <li><strong>Warm Reds:</strong> Auburn, copper, mahogany</li>
      <li><strong>Cool Blondes:</strong> Ash, pearl, platinum</li>
      <li><strong>Fashion Colors:</strong> Rose gold, violet, blue-black</li>
      <li><strong>Natural Enhancement:</strong> Deepening or brightening natural shade</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Maintaining Your New Colour</h3>
  <div class="bg-[#FFDEE2] bg-opacity-20 rounded-lg p-6 mb-6">
    <h4 class="font-semibold mb-3">Colour Care Essentials:</h4>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2">
      <li>Wait 48 hours before first wash</li>
      <li>Use colour-protecting shampoo and conditioner</li>
      <li>Wash with lukewarm water, rinse with cool</li>
      <li>Deep condition weekly for colour vibrancy</li>
      <li>Schedule <a href="/services/permanent-tint-touch-up/" class="text-salon-darkblue underline hover:text-[#0F7A9C]">root touch-ups</a> every 4-6 weeks</li>
      <li>Refresh all-over colour every 3-4 months</li>
      <li>Protect from sun, chlorine, and heat damage with a <a href="/services/uv-protection-treatments/" class="text-salon-darkblue underline hover:text-[#0F7A9C]">UV protection treatment</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Investment in Confidence</h3>
  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
    All-over colour is more than just a service – it's a complete transformation that can boost your confidence and refresh your entire look. Melissa's expertise ensures that your new colour not only looks stunning on day one but continues to impress as it grows out naturally.
  </p>

  <div class="bg-[#D3E4FD] bg-opacity-20 rounded-lg p-6">
    <p class="text-gray-700 italic">
      "There's something magical about finding your perfect colour. It's not just about changing your hair – it's about revealing the best version of yourself. All-over colour gives you that fresh start and confidence boost we all deserve."
    </p>
  </div>
  <!-- FAQ Schema -->
  <Fragment slot="after">
    <FAQSchema 
      faqs={faqs} 
      pageUrl="https://hairbymelissa.co.nz/services/permanent-tint-all-over/"
    />
  </Fragment>
</ServiceLayout>